    '- Use `aria-live="polite"` for status messages.\n' +
    '- Use `aria-describedby` for help text and error\n' +
    '\tmessages.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Keyboard interaction\n' +
    '- All interactive elements must be keyboard accessible.\n' +
