reading-time plugin: {
  textOnPage: 'In Gutenberg, you can create patterns of reusable code for use in your theme. You can load in the editor from those available in the WordPress pattern directory using the patterns top-level key.In this example, the pattern partner-logos refers to the pattern at https://wordpress.org/patterns/pattern/partner-logos{\n' +
    '    "version": 2,\n' +
    '    "patterns": [\n' +
    '      "short-text-surrounded-by-round-images", \n' +
    '      "partner-logos"\n' +
    '    ]\n' +
    '}This will make it easier to add new third-party patterns to your theme without having to create them yourself.',
