reading-time plugin: {
  textOnPage: 'OpenType fonts, both static and variable, make additional features available for developers to use.CSS makes these features available via the font-feature-settings property.Just like with font variations in variable fonts, we can use tools like Wakamaifondue to see what OpenType features are available (since they vary based on the font) and to download a stylesheet with all CSS necessary to use the features on your own project.We first set custom properties for each of the available OpenType layout features on the :root pseudo-element. We set them disabled by default so we can enable them for specific elements and classes.:root {\n' +
    '  --recursive-aalt: "aalt" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-afrc: "afrc" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-case: "case" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-dlig: "dlig" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-dnom: "dnom" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-frac: "frac" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-numr: "numr" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ordn: "ordn" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-pnum: "pnum" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-sinf: "sinf" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss01: "ss01" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss02: "ss02" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss03: "ss03" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss04: "ss04" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss05: "ss05" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss06: "ss06" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss07: "ss07" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss08: "ss08" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss09: "ss09" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss10: "ss10" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss11: "ss11" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss12: "ss12" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-ss20: "ss20" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-sups: "sups" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-titl: "titl" off;\n' +
    '  --recursive-zero: "zero" off;\n' +
    '}We then define how we’ll change and use these custom properties. Wakamaifondue uses a combination of feature queries and classes to define where the properties will change and how to use the correct font-variant-* in browsers that support the properties.The font-variant-* properties currently in the specification are:font-variant-ligaturesfont-variant-positionfont-variant-capsfont-variant-numericfont-variant-alternatesfont-variant-east-asian.recursive-aalt {\n' +
    '    --recursive-aalt: "aalt" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-afrc {\n' +
    '    --recursive-afrc: "afrc" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '@supports (font-variant-numeric: stacked-fractions) {\n' +
    '    .recursive-afrc {\n' +
    '        --recursive-afrc: "____";\n' +
    '        font-variant-numeric: stacked-fractions;\n' +
    '    }\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-case {\n' +
    '    --recursive-case: "case" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-dlig {\n' +
    '    --recursive-dlig: "dlig" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '@supports (font-variant-ligatures: discretionary-ligatures) {\n' +
    '    .recursive-dlig {\n' +
    '        --recursive-dlig: "____";\n' +
    '        font-variant-ligatures: discretionary-ligatures;\n' +
    '    }\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-dnom {\n' +
    '    --recursive-dnom: "dnom" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-frac {\n' +
    '    --recursive-frac: "frac" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '@supports (font-variant-numeric: diagonal-fractions) {\n' +
    '    .recursive-frac {\n' +
    '        --recursive-frac: "____";\n' +
    '        font-variant-numeric: diagonal-fractions;\n' +
    '    }\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-numr {\n' +
    '    --recursive-numr: "numr" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ordn {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ordn: "ordn" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '@supports (font-variant-numeric: ordinal) {\n' +
    '    .recursive-ordn {\n' +
    '        --recursive-ordn: "____";\n' +
    '        font-variant-numeric: ordinal;\n' +
    '    }\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-pnum {\n' +
    '    --recursive-pnum: "pnum" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '@supports (font-variant-numeric: proportional-nums) {\n' +
    '    .recursive-pnum {\n' +
    '        --recursive-pnum: "____";\n' +
    '        font-variant-numeric: proportional-nums;\n' +
    '    }\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-sinf {\n' +
    '    --recursive-sinf: "sinf" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss01 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss01: "ss01" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss02 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss02: "ss02" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss03 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss03: "ss03" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss04 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss04: "ss04" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss05 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss05: "ss05" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss06 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss06: "ss06" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss07 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss07: "ss07" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss08 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss08: "ss08" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss09 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss09: "ss09" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss10 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss10: "ss10" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss11 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss11: "ss11" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss12 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss12: "ss12" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-ss20 {\n' +
    '    --recursive-ss20: "ss20" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-sups {\n' +
    '    --recursive-sups: "sups" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '@supports (font-variant-position: super) {\n' +
    '    .recursive-sups {\n' +
    '        --recursive-sups: "____";\n' +
    '        font-variant-position: super;\n' +
    '    }\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-titl {\n' +
    '    --recursive-titl: "titl" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '@supports (font-variant-caps: titling-caps) {\n' +
    '    .recursive-titl {\n' +
    '        --recursive-titl: "____";\n' +
    '        font-variant-caps: titling-caps;\n' +
    '    }\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '.recursive-zero {\n' +
    '    --recursive-zero: "zero" on;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '@supports (font-variant-numeric: slashed-zero) {\n' +
    '    .recursive-zero {\n' +
    '        --recursive-zero: "____";\n' +
    '        font-variant-numeric: slashed-zero;\n' +
    '    }\n' +
    '}The final step is to apply the current state of all custom properties whenever a class is being used.Like with the font-variation-settings, we are using the low-level font-feature-settings property and can’t just change one and expect it to work so whenever we change one custom property, we propagate the changes everywhere..recursive-aalt,\n' +
    '.recursive-afrc,\n' +
    '.recursive-case,\n' +
    '.recursive-dlig,\n' +
    '.recursive-dnom,\n' +
    '.recursive-frac,\n' +
    '.recursive-numr,\n' +
    '.recursive-ordn,\n' +
    '.recursive-pnum,\n' +
    '.recursive-sinf,\n' +
    '.recursive-ss01,\n' +
    '.recursive-ss02,\n' +
    '.recursive-ss03,\n' +
    '.recursive-ss04,\n' +
    '.recursive-ss05,\n' +
    '.recursive-ss06,\n' +
