    '}Using the extended @font-face syntax we tell the browser that we’re loading a variable font using woff2-variations as the format.We also specify the font-weight range to be from 300 to 1000. We’ll leverage this later when we set up classes for predefined instances.In the :root element we use classes and variables to handle Open Type features. This section is taken from Wakamaifondue stylesheet for Cursive B025 (latest release when the post was written)The final:root {\n' +
