    '  "scripts": {\n' +
    '    "build": "webpack"\n' +
    '  },\n' +
    "}One last thing to consider. The configuration presented above will bundle everything together and that may not always be desirable.We can modify the Webpack configuration script to bundle all our vendor assets into separate chunks. The modified script looks like this:var webpack = require('webpack');\n" +
    "var path = require('path');\n" +
    '\n' +
    'module.exports = function(env) {\n' +
