reading-time plugin: {
  textOnPage: 'Hat Tip to : CSS Tricks.An accordion is a UX element to group related items like Frequently asked questions. Most libraries give you a way to create accordions. But there is an easier way to accomplish the same goal, use the details and summary elements.The details element creates a disclosure widget where information is visible only in its “open” state. A summary or label can be provided using the <summary> element.The companion summary element specifies a summary, caption, or legend for a <details> element’s disclosure box. Clicking the <summary> element toggles the state of the parent <details> element open and closed.You also get keyboard navigation for free. Thanks to HTML!The following HTML…<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n' +
    '\n' +
    '<details>\n' +
    '  <summary>What is the population of New Orleans?</summary>\n' +
    '<p>Every year, I took a holiday. I went to Florence, this cafe\n' +
    'on the banks of the Arno. Every fine evening, I would sit there\n' +
    'and order a Fernet Branca. I had this fantasy, that I would look\n' +
    'across the tables and I would see you there with a wife maybe a\n' +
    "couple of kids. You wouldn't say anything to me, nor me to you.\n" +
    "But we would both know that you've made it, that you were happy.\n" +
    'I never wanted you to come back to Gotham. I always knew there\n' +
    'was nothing here for you except pain and tragedy and I wanted\n' +
    'something more for you than that. I still do.</p>\n' +
    "</details>And this CSS code:@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Raleway:400,400i,700|Roboto:700');\n" +
    '\n' +
    'details {\n' +
    '  margin: 1rem;\n' +
    '}\n' +
    'summary {\n' +
    "  font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;\n" +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    'p {\n' +
    '  text-indent: 1em;\n' +
    "  font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;\n" +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    'h2 {\n' +
    "  font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;\n" +
    '  font-size: 2.5em;\n' +
    '  font-weight: bold;\n' +
    '}Produce the following page (shown as a Codepen Pen):See the Pen Deatils Accordion by Carlos Araya (@caraya) on CodePen.',
  readingTime: { text: '2 min read', minutes: 1.43, time: 85800, words: 286 }
}
