    '}Making it work in JavascriptNow that we have an idea of what we want to do, let’s look at how to do it. Because most of my content is web-based it makes the most sense to code this as a set of Javascript functions that run when the user completes certain actions on the page.Before we can submit a statement we have to connect and authenticate to the LRS we are working with.We u'... 4078 more characters,
