  textOnPage: 'A lot of times we see concepts like REST API or RESTful APIs but what is REST?This post will seek to answer that question alongside related questions in the context of a WordPress site using the WordPress REST API used through HTTPS.Defining RESTHow to USELinks and ResourcesArchitectural Styles and the Design of Network-based Software ArchitecturesClient-Server communication7 Awesome Free APIs for Your Next Node.js Project',
