    '\t}\n' +
    '\n' +
    '\treturn strings.TrimSpace(parts[1]), strings.TrimSpace(parts[2]), nil\n' +
    '}writeHTMLToFile handles opening, parsing and executing the template and populating it with the metadata and converted Markdown content.func writeHTMLToFile(buf bytes.Buffer, sourceFileName, destDir string, data interface{}) {\n' +
